<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt; I think maybe need \s* in (?&lt;STRING&gt;...&amp;#65289;also as some JSON file have space outside of "" &lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;code&gt;
(?&lt;STRING&gt;
  \s*
  (
    "
    (?:
      [^\\"]+
    |
      \\ ["\\/bfnrt]
    )*
    "
  )\s*
   (?{ [$^R, $^N] })
)&lt;/code&gt;</doctext>
